```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title>SkillStack | Order Confirmation</title>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <style type="text/css">
      /* Reset & Base */
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        min-width: 100%;
        font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f3f4f6;
        color: #1f2937;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      table {
        border-spacing: 0;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      img {
        border: 0;
      }

      a {
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      /* Layout */
      .container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 20px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }

      .header {
        padding: 48px 40px 32px 40px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
      }

      .body {
        padding: 40px;
      }

      .footer {
        padding: 32px 40px;
        background-color: #f9fafb;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #6b7280;
        border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
      }

      /* Typography */
      .brand-logo {
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #fbbf24;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        letter-spacing: -0.025em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 26px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.2;
        margin: 0;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0 0 24px 0;
        color: #4b5563;
      }

      /* Order Card */
      .order-card {
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        border-left: 4px solid #fbbf24;
        padding: 24px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }

      .order-label {
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #64748b;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
        display: block;
      }

      .order-value {
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #1e293b;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      /* Button */
      .button-wrapper {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 10px 0 30px 0;
      }

      .button {
        background-color: #2563eb;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        padding: 16px 32px;
        font-weight: 600;
        border-radius: 8px;
        display: inline-block;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
      }

      .link {
        color: #2563eb;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      /* Responsive */
      @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
        .container {
          border-radius: 0;
          margin: 0;
        }

        .header,
        .body {
          padding: 32px 24px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <table
      role="presentation"
      width="100%"
      cellspacing="0"
      cellpadding="0"
      border="0"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <div class="container">
            <!-- Header -->
            <div class="header">
              <div class="brand-logo">SKILLSTACK</div>
              <h1>Your Order Has Been Confirmed 🎉</h1>
            </div>

            <!-- Body -->
            <div class="body">
              <p>Hello,</p>

              <p>
                Thank you for your purchase! Your order has been successfully
                confirmed and your course is now ready to access.
              </p>

              <!-- Order Details -->
              <div class="order-card">
                <span class="order-label">Order ID</span>
                <div class="order-value"><%= order._id %></div>

                <span class="order-label">Course Name</span>
                <div class="order-value"><%= order.name %></div>

                <span class="order-label">Price</span>
                <div class="order-value">$<%= order.price %></div>

                <span class="order-label">Order Date</span>
                <div class="order-value"><%= order.date %></div>
              </div>

              <!-- Optional Button -->
              <!--
              <div class="button-wrapper">
                <a href="https://skillstack.com/dashboard" class="button">
                  Access Your Course
                </a>
              </div>
              -->

              <p style="font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 0;">
                Keep learning and building amazing things,<br />
                <strong>The SkillStack Team</strong>
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <div class="footer">
              <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
                If you have any questions, contact us at
                <a
                  href="mailto:support@skillstack.com"
                  class="link"
                >
                  support@skillstack.com
                </a>
              </p>

              <p
                style="
                  margin-top: 24px;
                  font-size: 11px;
                  text-transform: uppercase;
                  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
                  opacity: 0.6;
                "
              >
                &copy; 2026 SkillStack Inc. • Crafting the future of tech.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
```
